                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Clearly a port from mobile. At times it even says to \"touch the screen\"\n\nThe game is incredibly repetitive, there are some levels where there is only 1 enemy type, duplicated over and over again. There is no randomisation of sound either, so all these identical enemies say exactly the same thing when they see you, and when they die. you're running through the level and it's just this constant  loop of \nHEY! URG! HEY! URG! HEY! URG! HEY! URG!\n\nI played about the first 10 levels, there is some (very limited) variation in the objective and a few (simple) bosses.\n\nIt's not terrible, but there are better top view shooters out there.\n\n\n",
